{
  "tema": 7905,
  "slug": "gustar-pasado",
  "titulo": "Gustar and similar verbs in past tenses",
  "subtitulo": "¿Te gustó la película? Me encantaban las caricaturas.",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Gustar-type verbs work the same in every tense: indirect pronoun + verb in 3rd person, singular or plural to agree with the thing: me gustó / me gustaron, me molestaba.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Gustar** and the other reverse verbs (**encantar**, **interesar**, **molestar**, **importar**, **doler**…) work the same way in every tense."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The verb goes in the **3rd person**, singular or plural, to agree with **the thing** liked, not with the person. The person goes in the pronoun (**me**, **te**, **le**, **nos**, **les**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Tense",
            "Singular thing",
            "Plural things"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "preterite",
              "me gustó",
              "me gustaron"
            ],
            [
              "imperfect",
              "me gustaba",
              "me gustaban"
            ],
            [
              "present perfect",
              "me ha gustado",
              "me han gustado"
            ],
            [
              "pluperfect",
              "me había gustado",
              "me habían gustado"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Preterite: a specific experience (**¿te gustó la película?**). Imperfect: a feeling that lasted or a habit (**de niño me encantaban las caricaturas**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: find the thing first. It decides singular or plural, in any tense."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==Te gustó== el pozole ayer?",
              "en": "Did you like the pozole yesterday?"
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==me interesó== el discurso.",
              "en": "The speech didn't interest me."
            },
            {
              "es": "No me podía concentrar. El ruido ==me molestaba== mucho.",
              "en": "I couldn't concentrate. The noise was bothering me a lot."
            },
            {
              "es": "De joven no ==me interesaban== los deportes, pero ahora entreno diario.",
              "en": "When I was young I wasn't interested in sports, but now I train every day."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Nos encantaron== las olas de Ensenada.",
              "en": "We loved the waves in Ensenada."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nunca ==me habían gustado== los mariscos hasta que probé esos tacos.",
              "en": "I'd never liked seafood until I tried those tacos."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
